00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
[VIDEO GAME BEEPING]

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.360
MARK MIRCHANDANI: Cloud Bigtable
is Google's NoSQL big data

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.625
database service.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:10.750
It's the same database that
powers many core Google

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:15.370
services, including Search,
Analytics, Maps, and Gmail.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.610
Bigtable is designed to
handle massive workloads

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.540
at consistent low latency
and high throughput,

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.440
so it's a great choice for
both operational and analytical

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:27.280
applications, including
IoT, user analytics,

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.770
and financial data analysis.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:32.170
In this lab, you'll learn
how to use the CBT command

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:35.940
line to create and connect
to a Cloud Bigtable instance,

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.320
perform basic
administrative tasks,

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.762
and read and write
data in a table.

00:00:40.762 --> 00:00:42.220
We've added some
links below so you

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.600
can learn more about
Cloud Bigtable,

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.766
and see how it can help you
handle massive workloads

00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:48.056
quickly and seamlessly.

00:00:48.056 --> 00:00:49.930
This self-paced lab is
part of the Baseline--

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:52.740
Data, ML, and AI
quest on Quiklabs.

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:56.470
A quest is a series of related
labs that form a learning path.

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.360
Completing this quest
earns you this badge

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:00.490
to recognize your achievement.

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:02.950
Next up, Cloud
Natural Language API--

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.360
Qwik Start.

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:06.970
You'll be using a student GCP
account to work on these labs,

